   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi David,<div>We aren&#39;t typically setup to analyze R code, but I believe that what is happening here is that .indexwday is being impacted by the timezone that <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363854951000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3waVmOlQjVjS4Obt5oSkzH\">shinyapps.io</a> runs in. I don&#39;t know enough about .indexwday to know if you can pass in the timezone explicitly which would then fix the issue.</div><div><br></div><div>-Tareef</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Fri, Feb 27, 2015 at 9:22 AM, david shanabrook <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dhsh...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
