     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Have you tried modifying the locale?  There is some info on that <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!msg/shinyapps-users/VHKCz5B0QfE/FC8l2GVzl5EJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!msg/shinyapps-users/VHKCz5B0QfE/FC8l2GVzl5EJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363854954000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1H6KPxxlCiwtIURErQhoUG\">here</a> and <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/8145886/change-time-locale-for-r\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/8145886/change-time-locale-for-r&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363854954000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0jy1s5cOPEIQET_RMj0mvB\">here</a>.</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>On Friday, February 27, 2015 at 9:22:03 AM UTC-5, david shanabrook wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">I am using .indexwday on quantmod data and finding strange inconsistency with shiny  </span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">The code below works as expected, since there is no sunday stock data, the days of the week are set correctly.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">I use these same commands in my code to create a shiny web site, and when I launch it locally it again works fine.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">but when I deploy the same code to <a href=\"http://shiny.io\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363854954000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2muID3mY37iTVt87cnYWbi\">shiny.io</a>, the hosting service, it is no longer correct.  The correct code is: <span style=\"font-family:Monaco;font-size:13px;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">levels</span>=</span><span style=\"font-family:Monaco;font-size:13px\"><font color=\"#045218\">1:5 </font></span>which seems to imply there is sunday data.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">There is no difference in the local version and the <a href=\"http://shiny.io\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363854954000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2muID3mY37iTVt87cnYWbi\">shiny.io</a> version of the code, yet again in the <a href=\"http://shiny.io\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363854954000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2muID3mY37iTVt87cnYWbi\">shiny.io</a> implementation the levels are different.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">I can post more code if that would be helpful.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:13px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">library(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">shiny</span>)</div><div style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:13px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">library(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">quantmod</span>)</div><div style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:13px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(176,22,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(6,26,153)\">getSymbols(</span>&quot;AAPL&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(6,26,153)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">src</span><span style=\"color:rgb(6,26,153)\">=</span>&quot;yahoo&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(6,26,153)\">, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">from</span><span style=\"color:rgb(6,26,153)\">=</span>&quot;2015-02-10&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(6,26,153)\">)</span></div><div style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:13px;font-family:Monaco\"><span style=\"color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">daily</span>&lt;-factor(.indexwday(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">AAPL</span>),<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">levels</span>=</span><font color=\"#045218\">0</font><font color=\"#061a99\">:</font><font color=\"#045218\">4</font><font color=\"#061a99\">,</font>labels<font color=\"#061a99\">=c(</font><span style=\"color:rgb(176,22,0)\">&quot;Mon&quot;</span><font